# ---- source documents and everything derived from them ----------------------
# Most sources may not be redistributed (see redistribution_allowed in data/source_registry.csv):
# Saudi PHA guidelines (no licence statement), StatPearls (CC BY-NC-ND: no altered copies), the Saudi medication
# knowledge base (internal), the ADA standards (restricted), VITALA app documents (internal).
# Chunks, review queues, indexes and per-question evaluation outputs quote their text, so they stay private too.
data/raw/**
!data/raw/**/
!data/raw/medications/metformin_openfda_label_raw.json
!data/raw/medications/candidate_drug_manifest.json
data/processed/
data/archive/
indexes/
results/data_quality/
results/baseline/
results/evaluation/*/*
!results/evaluation/*/summary.json
!results/evaluation/*/report.md
results/evaluation/LATEST
results/*.log
